@title: login_wrong_password
@context: Wrong passwords and a wrongly cased name are refused; the right ones get in.
@tags: login
@import: * from '../lib/env.hunt'

STEP 1: Open the login page
    NAVIGATE to 'Login'
    VERIFY that the page is 'Login'

STEP 2: A wrong password
    FILL 'Username' field with 'ada'
    FILL 'Password' field with 'wrong'
    CLICK the 'Sign in' button
    VERIFY that 'Invalid username or password' is present

STEP 3: The right password in the wrong case
    FILL 'Password' field with 'LOVELACE'
    CLICK the 'Sign in' button
    VERIFY that 'Invalid username or password' is present
    VERIFY that 'Welcome, ada' is NOT present

STEP 4: The name in the wrong case
    FILL 'Username' field with 'Ada'
    FILL 'Password' field with 'lovelace'
    CLICK the 'Sign in' button
    VERIFY that 'Invalid username or password' is present

STEP 5: Both right
    FILL 'Username' field with 'ada'
    CLICK the 'Sign in' button
    VERIFY that 'Welcome, ada' is present
    VERIFY that 'Invalid username or password' is NOT present

STEP 6: Sign out
    CLICK the 'Logout' button
    VERIFY that the page is 'Login'

STEP 7: The error does not come back
    FILL 'Username' field with 'ada'
    VERIFY 'Username' field has value 'ada'
    VERIFY that 'Invalid username or password' is NOT present

DONE.
